            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Anwar el-Sadat</strong><br>\nAnwar el-Sadat was the third President of Egypt, serving from 1970 until his assassination in 1981. He is known for his daring initiative to make peace with Israel, which earned him the Nobel Peace Prize along with Israeli Prime Minister Menachem Begin. Sadat came into power after the death of President Gamal Abdel Nasser and inherited the challenges of a nation wounded by war and economic troubles.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Early Life and Military Career</strong><br>\nBorn on December 25, 1918, in Mit Abul Kom, Egypt, Sadat was raised in a family of 13 children. He joined the Royal Military Academy and graduated as an officer. His military service included a role in the 1973 October War against Israel, which, despite not achieving a decisive military victory, restored Egyptian pride and led to the recovery of the Sinai Peninsula.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Political Rise</strong><br>\nSadat's political rise began as a close confidant of Nasser, participating in the 1952 revolution which overthrew the monarchy. He held various high-ranking positions, including Vice President. Sadat's early policies sought to continue Nasser's socialist and pan-Arab ideologies but eventually shifted to a more pragmatic approach.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
